; *** Chapter 0: SETUP ***
; =====================================================

; SO
; HERE'S A FUN FACT FOR YOU
; TURNS OUT THAT AFTER THE AI FINISHES BUILDING A WONDER / MONUMENT
; IT BREAKS
; IT STOPS BUILDING ANYTHING EVER AGAIN
; no power cores, no shield generators, no military buildings
; not even any farms or any prefabs
; This is apparently an engine bug from AoK that was fixed in UP for AOE2, but we don't have UP and Grenadier's got lots of things to do
; so I don't expect it to get fixed any time soon
; AS SUCH
; the initial goal was "Wow the AI should save up for a monument in lategame Conquest for the flex"
; UNFORTUNATELY to do so would completely brick it 
; It would be possible, I guess, to lock it behind a 20k res threshold so that it only really got it after it could never feasibly run out of farms again
; But even then is still ... annoying
; instead we're going to go with the nuclear option
; bye bye file 
